A changelog is not a commit log. Highlights, not every detail: lead with what
operators and users need to know; small features and fixes get a brief
mention further down. Order the unreleased section by importance, not
chronology — reorder existing entries freely. Audience: a human, technical
but not fluent in the application's internals — moderate the jargon,
introduce an internal name before leaning on it, never write for a machine.
